{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y部分人物动机和心理转折压缩得比较厉害，尤其S07、S11，解释为什么犹豫、为什么改变主意，不如X充分。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的关键词加亮让普通观众能迅速抓住每段发生了什么，感受又随音乐时点出现，不必一次读完所有文字，扫屏负担更合理。它对声音、动作、身体反应和情绪细微变化的描写也更具体，而且反复出现的歌声、舞步、故乡等意象让音乐与人物经历形成联系。X的优势是叙事解释更充分，人物为什么犹豫、为什么转变交代得更完整，但综合实际观看体验，我选Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "17457e13-0821-4a73-90fe-dbcd612dc982", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T082526392569Z", "elapsed_seconds": 37.922, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T08:26:04.320456+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "96e0b1eb567a09ad448562c47241686ae70a7410655b995c6a6d5b49bacec8af", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": 